      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_16395\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_16395\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e. The calculator gives the squares of the numbers 0 through 10 as:\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e0, 1, 4, 9, 16, 25, 36, 49, 64, 81, 100\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-5 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_1_1_operations,expressions,andvariables_12a_1/f-1-12a-3.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
